vvdec
------------------------------------------
The Fraunhofer Versatile Video Decoder (VVdeC) is a fast VVC x86 software
decoder implementation. The decoder supports most standard features available
in the Main10 profile, with support for some high-level features still pending.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  libvvdec-devel-3.2.1-1bl1
  libvvdec3-3.2.1-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/fraunhoferhhi/vvdec

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/fraunhoferhhi/vvdec/archive/refs/tags/v3.2.1.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack vvdec-3.2.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./vvdec-3.2.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/vvdec-3.2.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/vvdec-3.2.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libvvdec3-3.2.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libvvdec-devel-3.2.1-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(vvdec)
  /usr/bin/vvdecapp.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/vvdec.README
  /usr/share/doc/vvdec/AUTHORS.md
  /usr/share/doc/vvdec/LICENSE.txt
  /usr/share/doc/vvdec/README.md

(libvvdec3)
  /usr/bin/cygvvdec-3.dll

(libvvdec-devel)
  /usr/include/vvdec/sei.h
  /usr/include/vvdec/version.h
  /usr/include/vvdec/vvdec.h
  /usr/include/vvdec/vvdecDecl.h
  /usr/lib/cmake/vvdec/vvdecConfig.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/vvdec/vvdecConfigVersion.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/vvdec/vvdecTargets-shared-relwithdebinfo.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/vvdec/vvdecTargets-shared.cmake
  /usr/lib/libvvdec.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libvvdec.pc

